  "next_steps": [
    "You will receive a confirmation email and final statement within several business days.",
    "You have 45 days from the closure request to redeem your 4,520 unredeemed rewards points; afterward, they will be forfeited.",
    "If an annual fee posted within the last 37 days, you may be eligible for a full refund."
  ]
}

{
  "status": "success",
  "message": "Your EcoCard has been permanently closed.",
  "account_id": "cc_e3f4a5b6c7_eco",
  "next_steps": [
    "You will receive a confirmation email and final statement within several business days.",
    "You have 45 days from the closure request to redeem your 2,890 unredeemed rewards points; afterward, they will be forfeited.",
    "If an annual fee posted within the last 37 days, you may be eligible for a full refund."
  ]
}

{
  "status": "unable_to_close",
  "message": "I can’t close your Gold Rewards Card yet because it has an outstanding balance of $175.00. The balance must be paid in full and any pending transactions must finish posting before closure can proceed.",
  "account_id": "cc_e3f4a5b6c7_gold",
  "required_action": "Pay the outstanding balance, then ask me to process the closure again."
}

{
  "status": "action_required",
  "message": "Before I complete the closure, what is the main reason you’d like to close your Gold Rewards Card? You may choose one of these: annual fee, not using the card, found a better card, unhappy with rewards, simplifying finances, negative experience, or another reason."
}

{
  "status": "action_required",
  "message": "I understand—the 3.25% rate on your frequent travel and software purchases could better match your spending. Rho-Bank’s Business Silver Rewards Card offers 10% cash back on eligible travel and software purchases and 1% on other purchases, subject to eligibility and merchant category coding. As a marketing consultant, you may wish to explore that option before closing your Gold Rewards Card.",
  "question": "Would you like help exploring the Business Silver Rewards Card, or do you still want to close your Gold Rewards Card?"
}

{
  "business_silver_rewards_card": {
    "cash_back": {
      "eligible_travel_purchases": "10.0%",
      "eligible_software_purchases": "10.0%",
      "other_purchases": "1.0%"
    },
    "annual_fee": "I couldn’t confirm the annual fee from the available Rho-Bank information.",
    "important_conditions": [
      "Rewards depend on the merchant being coded as travel or software.",
      "Eligible travel may include airfare, lodging, car rentals, and transit.",
      "Eligible software includes recurring SaaS and cloud-software subscriptions.",
      "An annual travel credit of up to $50 may apply.",
      "The foreign transaction fee is 1.5%."
    ]
  },
  "message": "The 10.0% rate is substantially higher than the 3.25% rate you mentioned, but I can’t accurately state the annual fee without an official fee disclosure."
}

{
  "status": "retention_offer",
  "message": "I understand. The Crypto-Cash Back Card earns 2.0% on eligible purchases, but crypto redemptions require at least $30, incur a 1.25% conversion fee, and the card has a $75 annual fee. If you rarely use cryptocurrency, those benefits may not justify keeping it.",
  "offer": {
    "option_1": "5,000 bonus points",
    "option_2": "$50 statement credit"
  },
  "question": "Would you like to accept one of these offers and keep the Crypto-Cash Back Card, or decline and proceed with permanent closure?"
}

{
  "status": "complete",
  "message": "You’re very welcome. Today, your Green Rewards Card and EcoCard were closed, your Gold Rewards Card balance was paid in full, and your Crypto-Cash Back Card remained open with a $50.00 retention statement credit applied. I’m glad we found an outcome that works for you."
}
